  "revision_20260912_expanded": "Expand Results and Discussion using preserved results and existing references; seven interpretation paragraphs, two limitations paragraphs and one conclusion; add full gene-level screen, matched OR/CI/P and posterior evidence, and candidate/prior sensitivity figures; preserve all analytical estimates and sensitivity limitations; update and verify documents, references and release identities.",
  "revision_20260912_figure2_layout": "Separate panels A and B with independent grids, wider gutter and vertical divider; remove background and gene colour from panel A, unify numeric typography and preserve panel B category colours. Numerical source record and manuscript/documents unchanged.",
  "revision_20260912_figure_labels": "Black text throughout all four figures; raised IGF1R label and darker point; nominal and BBJ discovery P markers with non-significant P unbolded; full-cell strong-support borders and padded matrix labels. Synchronize Figure 2–3 manuscript legends, regenerate main DOCX and table exports, review changed pages and preserve original numerical estimates.",
  "review_20260913": "Title and 33-reference order; H2 and variant-scale footnote; full estimator export with matching CIs; new TSHR reference-panel LD; conditional tolerance discussion; explicit unresolved multi-signal and directionality checks. This review supersedes prior readiness statements.",
